  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Требуется [мод Epic Fight &amp; мод Weapons of Miracle]</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/200/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"456\" height=\"456\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Этот мод обеспечивает совместимость с модами Epic Fight и Simply Swords!</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/201/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"361\" height=\"353\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/202/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"357\" height=\"288\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/204/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/205/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/208/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"364\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/210/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"360\" height=\"326\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/211/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"361\" height=\"334\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/213/2024-01-09_11.png\" width=\"364\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>Вопросы и ответы</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>В. Могу ли я использовать ваш мод в своём модпаке?</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>О. Конечно. Вы можете использовать все мои моды для своего модпака!</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Спасибо, что используете мой мод!</strong></span></p>",
